# Save as (revision 1 3.18) on a Shift_JIS CRLF file, vertical with numbers.
# 1: Ctrl+Shift+s opens the name box with the file's name.
C-t C-l "x" C-S-s SNAP
# 2: a new name in the same directory: saved there, edited from now on.
C-u "out.txt" RET SNAP
# 3: the next change goes to the autosave copy of the new name (no close).
"y" WAIT:31 SNAP
